WEBVTT

00:00:02.040 --> 00:00:09.130
(Chūka Ichiban)

00:01:34.500 --> 00:01:36.020
My name is Liu Maoxing.

00:01:36.510 --> 00:01:37.390
People all call me Mao.

00:01:38.420 --> 00:01:40.210
My mother was the head chef of the state-owned restaurant

00:01:40.340 --> 00:01:42.160
Chrysanthemum Tower.

00:01:42.710 --> 00:01:45.240
And I've grown up in the kitchen there.

00:01:45.530 --> 00:01:46.300
After my mother died,

00:01:46.580 --> 00:01:49.450
Shaoan and me decided to compete in
the Cooking Competition

00:01:49.570 --> 00:01:51.260
for the post \"successor to the head chef\".

00:01:55.090 --> 00:01:58.430
The theme proposed by
the judge Provincial Military Commander Li

00:01:58.580 --> 00:02:00.260
who is the leader of the cooking society is

00:02:01.250 --> 00:02:02.480
the Mystery Mapo Tofu

00:02:02.760 --> 00:02:04.650
which mixes six flavors.

00:02:09.540 --> 00:02:11.860
The Mystery Mapo Tofu Confrontation

00:02:17.940 --> 00:02:21.650
Compare the Mystery Mapo Tofu that mixes six flavors?

00:02:25.330 --> 00:02:26.680
The mix of six flavors which surpasses

00:02:27.070 --> 00:02:29.220
the perfection of five-flavored Mapo tofu.

00:02:30.320 --> 00:02:33.230
Provincial Military Commander,
what is the Mystery Mapo Tofu you said?

00:02:35.030 --> 00:02:36.390
Actually, I had only eaten

00:02:37.070 --> 00:02:39.000
that kind of Mapo tofu once.

00:02:40.100 --> 00:02:42.210
It happened ten years ago.

00:02:43.170 --> 00:02:44.830
At that time, I went to Sichuan with an order of

00:02:44.870 --> 00:02:46.350
the royal court.

00:02:46.780 --> 00:02:48.450
After I accomplished the difficult mission,

00:02:48.910 --> 00:02:50.550
I strained myself and walked into a restaurant.

00:02:51.800 --> 00:02:53.760
I was very weak at that time.

00:02:53.800 --> 00:02:55.200
However, they took

00:02:55.390 --> 00:02:56.510
Mapo tofu to me.

00:02:58.350 --> 00:02:59.100
It had a very strong smell.

00:02:59.690 --> 00:03:01.600
I thought I couldn't eat it.

00:03:03.770 --> 00:03:04.330
But

00:03:08.610 --> 00:03:10.090
that Mapo tofu was amazing.

00:03:13.420 --> 00:03:15.940
It was absorbed into my fatigued body

00:03:16.930 --> 00:03:18.430
and it tasted wonderful.

00:03:18.550 --> 00:03:20.560
I was saved by Mapo tofu. I kept eating faster.

00:03:20.980 --> 00:03:23.620
I finished three plates in the blink of an eye.

00:03:24.300 --> 00:03:25.710
Although ten years have passed,

00:03:25.760 --> 00:03:28.110
I still cannot figure out that texture.

00:03:28.460 --> 00:03:29.870
I can only say that

00:03:30.840 --> 00:03:33.730
it was an excellent combination of tofu and meat.

00:03:35.290 --> 00:03:38.290
Now that restaurant and that dish no longer exist.

00:03:39.250 --> 00:03:40.940
I hope I can taste

00:03:40.990 --> 00:03:43.290
that Mystery Mapo Tofu again.

00:03:44.090 --> 00:03:45.090
Listen to me carefully, guys.

00:03:45.910 --> 00:03:48.380
It can be said that Mapo tofu is
the symbol of Sichuan cuisine.

00:03:48.940 --> 00:03:49.780
It's no exaggeration to

00:03:49.830 --> 00:03:51.180
say that it can judge the cooking skills of

00:03:51.230 --> 00:03:52.330
a Sichuan chef.

00:03:54.130 --> 00:03:55.950
The cooking competition will hold at noon tomorrow.

00:03:56.280 --> 00:03:57.590
I hope you can go all out.

00:03:58.400 --> 00:03:58.930
OK.

00:04:02.780 --> 00:04:03.860
Think carefully about it after you go back.

00:04:04.420 --> 00:04:07.840
Maybe the answer is in your mind.

00:04:13.180 --> 00:04:14.530
The Mystery Mapo Tofu which could

00:04:14.580 --> 00:04:15.860
recover the extremely weak body

00:04:15.980 --> 00:04:17.980
of Provincial Military Commander Li

00:04:18.260 --> 00:04:19.730
in a gentle and effective way.

00:04:20.040 --> 00:04:22.540
A perfect combination of tofu and meat.

00:04:23.190 --> 00:04:25.110
And the mixed six flavors.

00:04:27.070 --> 00:04:27.710
Mao,

00:04:27.970 --> 00:04:29.460
since we have got all the ingredients now,

00:04:29.740 --> 00:04:30.840
let's have a try.

00:04:31.670 --> 00:04:32.260
OK.

00:04:32.870 --> 00:04:34.290
I don't know who on earth

00:04:34.910 --> 00:04:37.390
cooked the Mystery Mapo Tofu,

00:04:37.500 --> 00:04:39.760
but I'll try the mixed six flavors.

00:04:44.050 --> 00:04:44.850
Let's get started.

00:04:45.210 --> 00:04:46.360
First, add minced meat,

00:04:47.230 --> 00:04:48.370
chopped garlic,

00:04:48.650 --> 00:04:49.230
fermented black beans,

00:04:49.930 --> 00:04:50.690
and chilies.

00:04:51.090 --> 00:04:51.940
Then add sweet bean sauce.

00:04:52.640 --> 00:04:53.970
Next, add fermented chili bean paste which is

00:04:54.240 --> 00:04:54.970
the spirit of Sichuan cuisine.

00:05:00.110 --> 00:05:03.060
The spicy and hot flavor is
the first flavor \"spiciness\".

00:05:05.560 --> 00:05:06.130
One flavor.

00:05:07.050 --> 00:05:08.450
Next, I need to stir fry it

00:05:08.490 --> 00:05:09.260
until its color is bright.

00:05:09.600 --> 00:05:10.400
Take the stock.

00:05:11.230 --> 00:05:12.670
After adding stock,

00:05:15.410 --> 00:05:16.370
add tofu.

00:05:17.250 --> 00:05:19.280
Season it with wine and seasonings.

00:05:22.720 --> 00:05:23.420
Great.

00:05:24.470 --> 00:05:27.060
Simmer it for a while.

00:05:27.730 --> 00:05:28.470
After adding soy sauce,

00:05:28.520 --> 00:05:29.470
spread garlic shoots.

00:05:32.240 --> 00:05:34.340
The smell of the garlic shoots

00:05:34.970 --> 00:05:37.450
is the second flavor \"aroma\".

00:05:38.500 --> 00:05:39.000
Two flavors.

00:05:39.600 --> 00:05:42.450
Match chilies' red

00:05:42.510 --> 00:05:43.210
and tofu's white

00:05:43.770 --> 00:05:45.910
with garlic shoots' green.

00:05:46.590 --> 00:05:47.790
It's the third flavor \"color\".

00:05:49.550 --> 00:05:50.140
Three flavors.

00:05:51.330 --> 00:05:53.540
Mix starch with water.
Add the mixture to thicken the dish.

00:05:53.750 --> 00:05:54.620
I'm almost done.

00:05:55.220 --> 00:05:57.200
After pouring cooking oil alongside the pot,

00:05:57.360 --> 00:05:59.460
stir fry the food with high heat immediately.

00:06:00.150 --> 00:06:00.760
When Mapo tofu is done,

00:06:00.900 --> 00:06:03.280
the pot is almost burned.

00:06:03.730 --> 00:06:04.220
Only in this way can you make

00:06:04.270 --> 00:06:06.020
the best taste and aroma.

00:06:06.550 --> 00:06:09.430
That is the hot flavor \"hotness\".

00:06:11.270 --> 00:06:11.990
Four flavors.

00:06:13.870 --> 00:06:15.730
OK. The oil has floated up.

00:06:16.130 --> 00:06:16.870
Now it's the right time.

00:06:20.880 --> 00:06:22.580
In the end, spread enough Sichuan peppers.

00:06:23.880 --> 00:06:25.720
The spicy flavor of Sichuan peppers
with a bit numbing effect

00:06:26.010 --> 00:06:27.620
is numbness.

00:06:32.810 --> 00:06:34.180
That's it.

00:06:35.390 --> 00:06:36.720
Keling, have a taste now.

00:06:37.510 --> 00:06:40.490
It hurts. What are you doing?

00:06:40.760 --> 00:06:42.200
Are you done?

00:06:42.310 --> 00:06:43.760
It still lacks one flavor, right?

00:06:45.310 --> 00:06:50.300
It has spiciness, aroma, hotness and numbness.

00:06:51.160 --> 00:06:53.290
Right. It only has five flavors.

00:06:55.440 --> 00:06:56.240
It hurts so bad.

00:06:56.720 --> 00:06:59.400
Keling, why do you keep hitting me?

00:07:00.360 --> 00:07:02.140
It's not the time to laugh now.

00:07:02.790 --> 00:07:04.550
If we lose this competition,

00:07:04.910 --> 00:07:05.590
Shaoan will be

00:07:05.640 --> 00:07:07.320
the new head chef of Chrysanthemum Tower.

00:07:07.660 --> 00:07:09.930
It's okay if we get kicked out.

00:07:10.090 --> 00:07:10.750
But I'm not sure

00:07:10.800 --> 00:07:12.260
what punishments are waiting for us.

00:07:13.010 --> 00:07:13.820
OK. I got it.

00:07:14.230 --> 00:07:15.690
I'll try again from the start.

00:07:16.170 --> 00:07:17.930
Keling, your responsibility is to have a taste.

00:07:18.070 --> 00:07:19.010
OK. I'll handle it.

00:07:23.700 --> 00:07:25.910
Add one more flavor besides the five flavors.

00:07:26.330 --> 00:07:27.660
The sixth flavor is needed.

00:07:29.330 --> 00:07:30.350
To me, it cannot be counted

00:07:30.420 --> 00:07:33.000
as a mystery.

00:07:33.180 --> 00:07:34.380
It took you a bit more time,

00:07:34.430 --> 00:07:35.820
but Chrysanthemum Tower

00:07:35.860 --> 00:07:37.640
will be yours tomorrow.

00:07:38.190 --> 00:07:41.680
It's totally impossible for me to be the head chef of

00:07:41.730 --> 00:07:42.770
that kind of restaurants forever.

00:07:43.670 --> 00:07:44.280
It's just

00:07:44.330 --> 00:07:47.240
the first step to achieve my ambition.

00:07:47.370 --> 00:07:48.110
Ambition?

00:07:49.080 --> 00:07:50.390
Wait and see.

00:07:50.800 --> 00:07:53.140
Because of my cooking skills,

00:07:55.190 --> 00:07:56.630
one day

00:07:56.680 --> 00:07:59.020
even the emperor will yield to me.

00:08:05.400 --> 00:08:06.780
There are twelve hours left.

00:08:08.540 --> 00:08:10.990
No. Mao works so hard.

00:08:17.870 --> 00:08:19.720
Mao, wake up!

00:08:20.330 --> 00:08:21.550
Wake up! Look, what are you doing?

00:08:21.620 --> 00:08:23.430
Let me take a rest.

00:08:23.590 --> 00:08:24.550
What did you say?

00:08:25.070 --> 00:08:27.670
The destiny of Chrysanthemum Tower is in your hands.

00:08:27.790 --> 00:08:28.710
Wake up now! Wake up!

00:08:28.830 --> 00:08:31.490
Wait a moment, Keling.

00:08:31.640 --> 00:08:32.890
Wake up!

00:08:45.680 --> 00:08:47.500
Finally, only two hours left.

00:08:48.130 --> 00:08:48.780
Oh, no.

00:08:49.670 --> 00:08:51.900
I tried but I failed to figure out the sixth flavor.

00:08:53.440 --> 00:08:55.360
When I see the Mapo tofu,

00:08:55.400 --> 00:08:56.210
I can't help hiccupping.

00:08:57.240 --> 00:08:58.120
Me, too.

00:08:58.690 --> 00:09:00.300
Gosh.

00:09:01.200 --> 00:09:03.390
What on earth is the remaining flavor?

00:09:06.090 --> 00:09:07.080
In retrospect,

00:09:07.520 --> 00:09:09.870
I remember when we were both very young,

00:09:10.190 --> 00:09:12.830
we had eaten a lot of Mapo tofu quite a while.

00:09:13.560 --> 00:09:15.080
But it's amazing that

00:09:15.640 --> 00:09:17.220
even if we eat it every day like that,

00:09:17.510 --> 00:09:18.770
we still like it.

00:09:19.140 --> 00:09:20.280
It's that Mapo tofu.

00:09:21.680 --> 00:09:22.650
I also remember it.

00:09:23.310 --> 00:09:24.960
Mom's Mapo tofu

00:09:25.330 --> 00:09:26.830
was very refreshing

00:09:26.880 --> 00:09:28.260
because the meat was not greasy at all.

00:09:28.840 --> 00:09:31.510
I felt that every piece of meat was not greasy.

00:09:31.650 --> 00:09:33.990
It was very crispy and tasty.

00:09:34.160 --> 00:09:34.850
Mao,

00:09:34.900 --> 00:09:36.240
you remember it so clearly.

00:09:38.220 --> 00:09:39.040
That meat

00:09:39.440 --> 00:09:41.380
seems to be different from the normal meat.

00:09:41.920 --> 00:09:43.260
We ate it a long time ago.

00:09:43.310 --> 00:09:44.640
I can't remember it.

00:09:44.690 --> 00:09:47.590
The perfect combination of tofu and meat.

00:09:48.260 --> 00:09:49.460
At that time, the minced meat

00:09:49.830 --> 00:09:51.720
was minced beef, right?

00:09:52.020 --> 00:09:53.960
Anyway, it couldn't be chicken or pork.

00:09:54.110 --> 00:09:54.650
Wait a minute.

00:09:55.040 --> 00:09:56.230
Provincial Military Commander Li has also said that

00:09:56.960 --> 00:10:00.350
maybe the answer is in our mind, right?

00:10:00.800 --> 00:10:02.440
Yes. That's it.

00:10:02.730 --> 00:10:03.670
Mao, what's wrong?

00:10:04.440 --> 00:10:05.220
I see.

00:10:05.270 --> 00:10:06.180
My memory is

00:10:06.230 --> 00:10:08.680
filled with flavors of mom's dishes.

00:10:09.070 --> 00:10:10.230
What on earth are you talking about?

00:10:10.890 --> 00:10:11.570
I must figure it out.

00:10:12.040 --> 00:10:12.930
Try to think again.

00:10:29.140 --> 00:10:29.640
That is...

00:10:31.090 --> 00:10:31.600
Great.

00:10:33.860 --> 00:10:34.940
What are you looking for?

00:10:38.600 --> 00:10:40.700
I'm right. That year.

00:10:41.660 --> 00:10:42.300
What's up?

00:10:43.410 --> 00:10:44.430
I remember all the things.

00:10:45.120 --> 00:10:45.820
What?

00:10:46.860 --> 00:10:47.520
Keling,

00:10:48.210 --> 00:10:50.560
our mother was amazing!

00:10:50.600 --> 00:10:51.380
Wonderful!

00:10:52.790 --> 00:10:53.960
Mao, what's wrong with you?

00:10:55.470 --> 00:10:56.740
Where are you going?

00:10:57.070 --> 00:10:58.740
The competition is going to start soon.

00:10:59.840 --> 00:11:00.740
Mao!

00:11:04.420 --> 00:11:05.060
The last flavor

00:11:05.110 --> 00:11:06.760
I tried but failed to figure out.

00:11:07.410 --> 00:11:10.440
I finally know the sixth flavor!

00:11:18.090 --> 00:11:19.970
(Chūka Ichiban)

00:11:23.030 --> 00:11:23.670
Now the review of

00:11:23.790 --> 00:11:26.220
Chrysanthemum Tower Cooking Competition starts.

00:11:26.780 --> 00:11:27.880
Shaoan, Mao,

00:11:28.090 --> 00:11:29.160
are you ready?

00:11:29.350 --> 00:11:29.730
Yes.

00:11:36.610 --> 00:11:38.270
Mapo tofu of Sichuan

00:11:38.560 --> 00:11:41.760
should be numbing, spicy, colorful, aromatic and hot.

00:11:42.190 --> 00:11:43.710
It mixes the five flavors.

00:11:44.680 --> 00:11:45.900
Now I'm gonna ask you

00:11:46.490 --> 00:11:47.980
what is the sixth flavor

00:11:48.260 --> 00:11:49.070
that is critical to

00:11:49.120 --> 00:11:50.440
the Mystery Mapo tofu?

00:11:50.560 --> 00:11:51.450
It's...

00:11:51.520 --> 00:11:52.120
It's...

00:11:52.790 --> 00:11:53.860
- It's crispness.
- It's crispness.

00:11:53.870 --> 00:11:54.830
(Crispiness)

00:11:55.980 --> 00:11:56.730
That kid...

00:11:57.360 --> 00:11:58.690
Shaoan has discovered it as well.

00:11:59.640 --> 00:12:00.260
Great.

00:12:00.640 --> 00:12:02.380
Both of you have discovered it.

00:12:02.980 --> 00:12:04.150
The so-called crispness

00:12:04.270 --> 00:12:05.610
is the crispy texture attribute.

00:12:05.990 --> 00:12:07.970
And it's true that the sixth flavor I requested

00:12:08.270 --> 00:12:09.720
is crispness.

00:12:11.390 --> 00:12:12.570
I'm right.

00:12:12.870 --> 00:12:14.510
It's relatively hard to make a request

00:12:14.550 --> 00:12:15.950
for the texture of Mapo tofu.

00:12:16.560 --> 00:12:17.690
The extra flavor besides the five flavors

00:12:17.740 --> 00:12:20.290
must be related to the texture.

00:12:20.690 --> 00:12:22.100
Now I'm gonna taste

00:12:22.280 --> 00:12:24.100
your Mapo tofu.

00:12:47.640 --> 00:12:49.040
Looks like both dishes are delicious.

00:12:49.260 --> 00:12:49.720
Yes.

00:12:49.810 --> 00:12:52.140
Mapo tofu is the source of our energy.

00:12:52.240 --> 00:12:53.460
The two dishes are both good in appearance.

00:12:53.610 --> 00:12:55.330
The key to winning is

00:12:56.100 --> 00:12:57.290
the sixth flavor.

00:12:58.030 --> 00:12:59.060
First,

00:12:59.620 --> 00:13:00.980
I'm gonna taste Shaoan's dish.

00:13:14.850 --> 00:13:16.110
What is he doing?

00:13:17.610 --> 00:13:19.170
Provincial Military Commander Li is so great.

00:13:19.260 --> 00:13:20.330
He has discovered it.

00:13:28.930 --> 00:13:29.550
Amazing.

00:13:29.930 --> 00:13:32.140
It has been piled so high but it won't fall.

00:13:32.500 --> 00:13:34.260
The elasticity of this tofu is very good.

00:13:34.390 --> 00:13:35.530
So is its texture.

00:13:36.020 --> 00:13:37.440
This is the top combination

00:13:37.490 --> 00:13:38.680
of tofu and meat.

00:13:39.740 --> 00:13:40.790
An excellent work.

00:13:41.580 --> 00:13:42.940
So the winner is him?

00:13:44.290 --> 00:13:46.940
Kid, now you're at the end of your rope.

00:13:47.220 --> 00:13:49.110
I didn't expect that

00:13:49.370 --> 00:13:50.490
the crispness refers to tofu.

00:13:51.140 --> 00:13:53.720
But if my thought is right...

00:13:54.780 --> 00:13:56.220
Now it's Mao's turn.

00:13:57.110 --> 00:13:58.680
He's gonna taste Mao's Mapo tofu.

00:14:18.780 --> 00:14:19.370
This is...

00:14:28.750 --> 00:14:30.570
Provincial Military Commander
hasn't put tofu on a small plate.

00:14:30.620 --> 00:14:32.230
He's eating tofu of the big plate directly.

00:14:36.310 --> 00:14:36.920
What's going on?

00:14:55.510 --> 00:14:57.960
He... He finished the tofu immediately.

00:14:58.280 --> 00:15:01.220
I've tasted both of your works.

00:15:01.700 --> 00:15:04.340
The sixth flavor I request is crispness.

00:15:04.800 --> 00:15:05.850
Shaoan has

00:15:05.900 --> 00:15:07.160
applied the crispness on tofu,

00:15:07.730 --> 00:15:10.030
while Mao has applied it on another thing.

00:15:11.550 --> 00:15:14.150
Ten years ago, the Mystery Mapo Tofu

00:15:14.520 --> 00:15:17.260
recovered my body in a gentle and effective way.

00:15:18.660 --> 00:15:20.430
In fact, the crispness

00:15:20.830 --> 00:15:21.960
is not about tofu.

00:15:22.060 --> 00:15:22.910
It's about minced meat.

00:15:23.880 --> 00:15:24.570
Minced meat?

00:15:25.280 --> 00:15:27.100
Mao's Mapo tofu

00:15:27.460 --> 00:15:28.650
is world's

00:15:28.760 --> 00:15:30.750
unique Mystery Mapo Tofu.

00:15:32.470 --> 00:15:33.550
The crispness of the meat

00:15:33.640 --> 00:15:36.700
is the real sixth flavor.

00:15:37.090 --> 00:15:38.470
Excuse me, Provincial Military Commander.

00:15:38.580 --> 00:15:40.050
Even if the crispness is about the meat,

00:15:40.350 --> 00:15:42.030
the meat I used is very good.

00:15:42.070 --> 00:15:42.800
It must be delicious.

00:15:42.850 --> 00:15:43.750
Even the elasticity of my meat

00:15:43.960 --> 00:15:46.150
cannot be worse than that of Mao's meat.

00:15:46.560 --> 00:15:47.850
There is a difference between your minced meat and his.

00:15:48.190 --> 00:15:50.660
Look carefully and try to find the difference.

00:15:51.220 --> 00:15:52.820
This is your minced meat.

00:15:57.720 --> 00:15:59.700
This is Mao's minced meat.

00:16:06.830 --> 00:16:07.430
Did you see it?

00:16:08.390 --> 00:16:09.210
Mao's minced meat is

00:16:09.260 --> 00:16:11.580
so elastic that it bounced out
after being cut into two pieces.

00:16:11.740 --> 00:16:13.320
Shaoan's meat hasn't been cut off.

00:16:13.530 --> 00:16:14.540
It has only been flattened out.

00:16:16.490 --> 00:16:17.640
The meat is amazing.

00:16:18.200 --> 00:16:19.250
No matter what kind of meat it is

00:16:19.690 --> 00:16:21.490
and how hard you tried to mince it,

00:16:21.540 --> 00:16:23.450
it must contain tendons.

00:16:24.530 --> 00:16:25.800
However, Mao's meat

00:16:26.330 --> 00:16:27.990
has been heated evenly

00:16:28.060 --> 00:16:29.530
and it has no tendons.

00:16:30.160 --> 00:16:31.990
The smooth texture.

00:16:33.270 --> 00:16:33.820
Mao.

00:16:33.950 --> 00:16:34.310
Yes, sir.

00:16:34.570 --> 00:16:35.840
What on earth is the meat?

00:16:36.740 --> 00:16:39.070
Provincial Military Commander, it's not meat actually.

00:16:39.200 --> 00:16:39.750
What?

00:16:40.030 --> 00:16:41.050
It's not meat?

00:16:41.720 --> 00:16:42.750
The secret

00:16:44.470 --> 00:16:45.000
is this.

00:16:45.640 --> 00:16:46.580
What is it?

00:16:47.050 --> 00:16:48.630
That's the secret.

00:16:49.360 --> 00:16:51.060
Guys, please follow me to the kitchen.

00:16:53.090 --> 00:16:54.720
Actually, this is

00:16:55.340 --> 00:16:56.030
my minced meat.

00:17:00.600 --> 00:17:02.540
The meat is made from

00:17:03.480 --> 00:17:04.220
soybean.

00:17:06.620 --> 00:17:08.520
The soybean is known as the meat of the field.

00:17:09.120 --> 00:17:10.120
Soybean?

00:17:10.170 --> 00:17:12.120
How to turn the soybean

00:17:12.430 --> 00:17:13.830
into meat?

00:17:14.360 --> 00:17:14.760
Yes, sir.

00:17:15.860 --> 00:17:17.860
(Diagrams of the dish)

00:17:18.440 --> 00:17:21.930
First, boil water-soaked soybeans with soup.

00:17:22.090 --> 00:17:24.330
Second, smash and squish soybeans.

00:17:24.450 --> 00:17:27.430
Third, season them with sauce.

00:17:29.750 --> 00:17:30.760
The tastiness of the gravy

00:17:30.810 --> 00:17:31.830
has been replaced by

00:17:31.960 --> 00:17:33.750
water and taste of this sauce.

00:17:33.800 --> 00:17:34.670
Wait a minute.

00:17:35.260 --> 00:17:37.850
After being boiled in the pot,

00:17:37.900 --> 00:17:39.830
this flavor will be spread in the Mapo tofu.

00:17:40.270 --> 00:17:41.590
Then it'll be impossible for tofu

00:17:41.640 --> 00:17:42.720
to have the same texture as meat.

00:17:43.930 --> 00:17:44.740
Anyway,

00:17:44.780 --> 00:17:45.820
if you just grind and season the soybean,

00:17:46.440 --> 00:17:48.140
you'll be unable to replace meat with it.

00:17:48.720 --> 00:17:49.500
Absolutely right.

00:17:50.390 --> 00:17:51.040
So

00:17:52.810 --> 00:17:53.570
fry soybeans with

00:17:53.620 --> 00:17:55.140
cooking oil quickly in the end

00:17:55.190 --> 00:17:56.760
to maintain the flavor of the sauce

00:17:56.910 --> 00:17:58.970
(The elasticity of the meat The flavor of the sauce)
and harden it duly.

00:17:59.150 --> 00:18:01.250
(The elasticity of the meat The flavor of the sauce)
The texture of soybeans will be close to that of meat.

00:18:01.510 --> 00:18:03.870
(The elasticity of the meat The flavor of the sauce)
It looks like that after I'm done.

00:18:05.790 --> 00:18:07.200
It looks like meat, right?

00:18:09.580 --> 00:18:10.610
I see.

00:18:11.610 --> 00:18:13.240
Replace minced meat by soybeans?

00:18:16.930 --> 00:18:18.540
This taste is...

00:18:19.570 --> 00:18:21.430
Looks like you've discovered that, Shaoan.

00:18:24.210 --> 00:18:26.930
The chef who made the Mystery Mapo Tofu

00:18:27.300 --> 00:18:29.450
is the head chef of Chrysanthemum Tower

00:18:29.600 --> 00:18:31.560
who's known as the fairy of Sichuan cuisine.

00:18:32.230 --> 00:18:33.420
She's your teacher

00:18:33.540 --> 00:18:34.590
and Mao's mother.

00:18:35.350 --> 00:18:36.660
So I drew up this theme

00:18:36.710 --> 00:18:37.840
for you.

00:18:38.470 --> 00:18:39.370
I knew it.

00:18:40.800 --> 00:18:42.960
Chef Pai's Mapo tofu.

00:18:43.440 --> 00:18:44.200
Mom.

00:18:44.330 --> 00:18:45.050
Mao,

00:18:45.310 --> 00:18:46.980
you've discovered it.

00:18:47.470 --> 00:18:49.740
I wondered if the Mystery Mapo Tofu was

00:18:50.030 --> 00:18:51.700
made by my mom,

00:18:52.200 --> 00:18:53.500
so I had a check.

00:18:53.550 --> 00:18:55.130
It was about ten years ago

00:18:56.010 --> 00:18:57.530
when you arrived here.

00:18:57.820 --> 00:18:58.920
I found that rinderpest

00:18:59.110 --> 00:19:00.440
took place nearby.

00:19:00.750 --> 00:19:01.930
People couldn't get meat

00:19:02.220 --> 00:19:04.960
so they couldn't make Mapo tofu that year.

00:19:05.320 --> 00:19:06.000
OK.

00:19:06.570 --> 00:19:08.830
I did come here that year.

00:19:09.340 --> 00:19:10.180
Mapo tofu

00:19:10.470 --> 00:19:12.870
is people's favorite dish.

00:19:13.330 --> 00:19:14.080
To use

00:19:14.130 --> 00:19:16.270
another ingredient to make Mapo tofu,

00:19:16.460 --> 00:19:17.340
my mother spared no effort.

00:19:18.070 --> 00:19:19.150
I remember my sister and me

00:19:19.300 --> 00:19:20.820
have eaten a lot of trial dishes

00:19:20.870 --> 00:19:23.090
of Mapo tofu made by my mom.

00:19:24.210 --> 00:19:24.720
So later,

00:19:25.050 --> 00:19:26.970
based on my memory, I tried to recall the past.

00:19:27.430 --> 00:19:30.070
Finally, I'm certain that
the new ingredient is the soybean.

00:19:30.420 --> 00:19:31.180
So Mao

00:19:32.140 --> 00:19:34.200
you solved the mystery by thinking about the taste

00:19:34.850 --> 00:19:36.960
of Mapo tofu you ate when you were young?

00:19:37.940 --> 00:19:38.430
Yes.

00:19:38.820 --> 00:19:39.540
As long as I eat

00:19:39.840 --> 00:19:40.900
mom's dish once,

00:19:40.950 --> 00:19:42.120
I can remember its taste.

00:19:42.430 --> 00:19:43.190
OK.

00:19:44.300 --> 00:19:44.980
Shaoan,

00:19:46.690 --> 00:19:48.100
after you learned cooking skills

00:19:48.150 --> 00:19:50.290
from Chef Pai, you became arrogant.

00:19:50.890 --> 00:19:52.590
But you haven't learned

00:19:52.730 --> 00:19:53.220
the most important foundations

00:19:53.270 --> 00:19:54.500
of cooking which Chef Pai wanted to

00:19:54.570 --> 00:19:56.660
teach you most.

00:19:57.790 --> 00:19:59.400
She hoped people who like Mapo tofu

00:20:00.070 --> 00:20:01.060
could eat Mapo tofu

00:20:01.110 --> 00:20:03.520
even without beef.

00:20:04.070 --> 00:20:05.670
In the end, she made Mapo tofu with the soybean

00:20:05.960 --> 00:20:08.990
which is as good as beef.

00:20:09.080 --> 00:20:10.140
Chef Pai

00:20:10.490 --> 00:20:11.860
concerned others

00:20:12.180 --> 00:20:13.760
and she was a sincere chef,

00:20:13.810 --> 00:20:15.290
so she succeeded.

00:20:15.740 --> 00:20:17.550
People who don't understand this simple reason

00:20:17.670 --> 00:20:18.630
is not qualified to

00:20:18.700 --> 00:20:21.340
be the head chef of
the state-owned restaurant Chrysanthemum Tower.

00:20:25.840 --> 00:20:26.400
Mao,

00:20:26.730 --> 00:20:27.540
you succeeded to copy

00:20:27.590 --> 00:20:28.930
Chef Pai's dish.

00:20:29.360 --> 00:20:30.160
You're amazing.

00:20:30.570 --> 00:20:32.380
Thank you so much, Provincial Military Commander Li.

00:20:33.590 --> 00:20:34.460
Mao!

00:20:34.570 --> 00:20:36.040
Great, Keling!

00:20:36.440 --> 00:20:37.790
You're so great, Mao.

00:20:43.810 --> 00:20:45.210
Remember it, Liu Maoxing.

00:20:45.700 --> 00:20:48.000
I won't give up like that.

00:20:53.980 --> 00:20:56.280
It is said that all outstanding chefs

00:20:56.720 --> 00:20:59.270
of any times can figure out the ingredients

00:20:59.430 --> 00:21:02.460
of a dish by the memory for its taste.

00:21:03.390 --> 00:21:04.560
Even I failed to solve

00:21:04.610 --> 00:21:06.070
the mystery of minced meat.

00:21:06.390 --> 00:21:07.560
This boy

00:21:07.610 --> 00:21:09.560
solved it by the memory for his life ten years ago.

00:21:09.960 --> 00:21:12.160
I think restaurants of Sichuan Province

00:21:12.200 --> 00:21:13.690
are not enough for him.

00:21:15.290 --> 00:21:15.900
Mao.

00:21:16.340 --> 00:21:16.830
Yes, sir.

00:21:17.410 --> 00:21:20.250
Before I appoint you as
new head chef of Chrysanthemum Tower,

00:21:20.300 --> 00:21:21.560
I have a condition.

00:21:23.680 --> 00:21:24.630
The condition is that

00:21:25.340 --> 00:21:27.700
you study in the gourmet capital Guangzhou

00:21:28.400 --> 00:21:30.200
like your mother Chef Pai.

00:21:30.780 --> 00:21:33.010
You need to get the qualification for Super Chef.

00:21:33.270 --> 00:21:34.280
Su- Super...

00:21:41.010 --> 00:21:42.230
Super Chef...

00:21:49.890 --> 00:21:54.560
(Super)

00:23:14.851 --> 00:23:17.812
Preview of the next episode

00:23:17.812 --> 00:23:19.310
When I arrived in Guangzhou,

00:23:19.310 --> 00:23:19.314
When I arrived in Guangzhou,
I visited Yang Spring Restaurant, a restaurant
introduced by Provincial Military Commander Li.

00:23:19.314 --> 00:23:22.160
I visited Yang Spring Restaurant, a restaurant
introduced by Provincial Military Commander Li.

00:23:22.160 --> 00:23:25.266
However, a scary-looking sous-chef named Zhou Yu

00:23:25.266 --> 00:23:28.365
rolled up Provincial Military Commander's
introduction letter and threw it away.

00:23:28.860 --> 00:23:30.453
Next episode, Chūka Ichiban!

00:23:30.453 --> 00:23:32.410
Go For It! Super Chef

00:23:32.410 --> 00:23:33.745
It will definitely be interesting!
